# Cloudflare Pages → Render proxy.
# Landing pages (tip-better, next-show) POST to /api/subscribe. Cloudflare
# serves the HTML; Render runs the Python API. These rules keep the
# subscribe flow same-origin so no CORS preflight is required in the browser.
/api/* https://howtocookathome.onrender.com/api/:splat 200
/unsubscribe/* https://howtocookathome.onrender.com/unsubscribe/:splat 200
